{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_e64e8c54b5f173a19cbd4734210c46a2ac20efdfd85764d2bef4bdc46997b7a7"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A github_issue_debug.py script accepts a GitHub token, repo, and issue number, with optional flags for build/test/reproduction/regression validation, Docker environment configuration, candidate patch count, and pushing fixes to a remote branch."}],"claim_ids":["clm_e64e8c54b5f173a19cbd4734210c46a2ac20efdfd85764d2bef4bdc46997b7a7"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:48:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_a51330dc4bbc41428b305f1d7f7014c1","id":"pg_27fe9b2c891e570c9b494bf264bb7619","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/euniai-prometheus-docs-github-issue-debug-guide-md-acb83608ed7f-4bf264bb7619.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_cd316211208c5b7aa06e4461af3ad639"],"title":"EuniAI/Prometheus/docs/GitHub-Issue-Debug-Guide.md @ acb83608ed7f","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:48:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a51330dc4bbc41428b305f1d7f7014c1"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_93af3b69be5a67192d4a10c2cebbb23eb021f6f6a3a7c3da0b34c38f0d4268f5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors use ruff for linting/formatting, must write tests for every change, run the pytest suite (excluding git-marked tests) with coverage before pushing, and submit PRs that pass CI and maintainer review."}],"claim_ids":["clm_93af3b69be5a67192d4a10c2cebbb23eb021f6f6a3a7c3da0b34c38f0d4268f5"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:48:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_a51330dc4bbc41428b305f1d7f7014c1","id":"pg_60fdf4817d8e5978aa44e98231b0b39c","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/euniai-prometheus-contributing-md-acb83608ed7f-e98231b0b39c.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_263da69212495d45a4b9d202b12c027b"],"title":"EuniAI/Prometheus/CONTRIBUTING.md @ acb83608ed7f","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:48:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a51330dc4bbc41428b305f1d7f7014c1"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_2481920edbd1cdf058591e47861baf814d430f893a4876f03c7f54ef5962a79e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Agents communicate through shared LangGraph state: each subgraph has a typed state dictionary, state flows through nodes, child subgraphs inherit parent state, and results return via state."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5c55f8bdb469d823199c245dca25af81d6ebc7bfe9ae38ce991fcdbc1122d8c4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The issue resolution agent generates multiple candidate patches, validates them against reproduction tests (required) plus optional regression and existing tests, and selects the best patch using an LLM with retry on failure."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a7d623e87abb0a1562618cd4240ed1d87148e8a53ebe6746e1e32feeac92dc4b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The bug reproduction agent generates reproduction tests via LLM, executes them in Docker, evaluates success, and retries with feedback in iterative loops."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ffad3c20a3a1bdc9233b5338442c7b1002e6aedda687a51232a524c5b71af854"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The Environment Build Agent is documented as in-progress with only planned features (auto-detecting project type, installing dependencies, configuring build tools), and PR review, feature implementation, and documentation agents are listed as future enhancements."}],"claim_ids":["clm_2481920edbd1cdf058591e47861baf814d430f893a4876f03c7f54ef5962a79e","clm_5c55f8bdb469d823199c245dca25af81d6ebc7bfe9ae38ce991fcdbc1122d8c4","clm_a7d623e87abb0a1562618cd4240ed1d87148e8a53ebe6746e1e32feeac92dc4b","clm_ffad3c20a3a1bdc9233b5338442c7b1002e6aedda687a51232a524c5b71af854"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:48:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_a51330dc4bbc41428b305f1d7f7014c1","id":"pg_93f6ca5364975c36a227bd3edbb27eb2","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/euniai-prometheus-docs-multi-agent-architecture-md-acb83608ed7f-bd3edbb27eb2.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_234d50c3503d5471ba57b8aefd5787b2"],"title":"EuniAI/Prometheus/docs/Multi-Agent-Architecture.md @ acb83608ed7f","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:48:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a51330dc4bbc41428b305f1d7f7014c1"}
